=== LINE STATE ==============================================================

  chip: bcdDevice=0x0600  ->  FT232R / FT245R
  resting pin levels, 200 samples while silent:
    0xFF  11111111  200/200  (100%)
  pin levels while transmitting:
    0xFF  11111111  161/200  (80%)
    0xFE  11111110   20/200  (10%)     bit0 = TXD low
    0xFD  11111101   11/200  ( 5%)     bit1 = RXD low
    0xFC  11111100    8/200  ( 4%)     both low
  passive listen, no transmission:
     9600 baud, 3 s: nothing
    10400 baud, 3 s: nothing

Compare the desk control, where RXD never left high while transmitting.
On the car it does, so the transceiver is powered and the loop closes.

